# jobseek-skills — keep real applicant data and build outputs out of this repo.
# This file is a backstop, not a guarantee: always check `git status` before
# committing. Real applicant data belongs outside this public repo, or in a
# separate private repository.

# --- Dashboard / app databases (caches seeded from the applicant-data kit) ---
app.db
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# --- Legacy v1 workflow state ---
state.json

# --- Real applicant working files (blank templates live in templates/) ---
dossier.md
LEDGER.md
TRACKER.md
# Exception: the fictional sample dataset ships its own ledger for the
# acceptance test, and that one IS committed.
!examples/**/LEDGER.md

# --- The applicant-data kit: only its specification README is committed ---
applicant-data/*
!applicant-data/README.md

# --- Built application packages and generated documents ---
applications/
**/*.docx
**/*.pdf
# Exception: everything under examples/ is fictional sample material and is
# committed, including any sample documents.
!examples/**

# --- Dependencies and OS noise ---
node_modules/
.DS_Store
